  "ruleText": "Tra 904.01 Registration of Commercial Aviation Operators Required. Pursuant to RSA 422:21, each commercial aviation operator shall register with the department.\n\nSource. #7997, eff 12-1-03; ss by #10034, eff 11-23-11 (from Tra 903.01)\n\nNew. #13480, eff 11-3-22",
